{"applicability_conditions":"适用于具有多级微观结构的低密度钢；基于等功（isowork）理论，假设拉伸功在所有相（F、B/TM、FM、RA、DIM）中均匀分布。","identity":{"block_id":"b0061","equation_id":"equation_001","equation_number":"1","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\n\\sigma_ {\\mathrm{F}} \\mathrm{d} \\varepsilon_ {\\mathrm{F}} = \\sigma_ {\\mathrm{B/TM}} \\mathrm{d} \\varepsilon_ {\\mathrm{B/TM}} = \\sigma_ {\\mathrm{FM}} \\mathrm{d} \\varepsilon_ {\\mathrm{FM}} = \\sigma_ {\\mathrm{RA}} \\mathrm{d} \\varepsilon_ {\\mathrm{RA}} = \\sigma_ {\\mathrm{DIM}} \\mathrm{d} \\varepsilon_ {\\mathrm{DIM}}\\tag{1}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1016_j.cja.2025.103802"},"latex":"\\sigma_{\\mathrm{F}} \\mathrm{d} \\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{F}} = \\sigma_{\\mathrm{B/TM}} \\mathrm{d} \\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{B/TM}} = \\sigma_{\\mathrm{FM}} \\mathrm{d} \\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{FM}} = \\sigma_{\\mathrm{RA}} \\mathrm{d} \\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{RA}} = \\sigma_{\\mathrm{DIM}} \\mathrm{d} \\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{DIM}}","purpose":"表达等功（isowork）理论假设：在低密度钢的多级微观结构中，拉伸功均匀分布于各相，即各相流变应力与相应真应变增量的乘积彼此相等。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"F 相的流变应力（rheological stress）","symbol":"\\sigma_{\\mathrm{F}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"F 相的真应变增量","symbol":"\\mathrm{d}\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{F}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"B/TM 相的流变应力","symbol":"\\sigma_{\\mathrm{B/TM}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"B/TM 相的真应变增量","symbol":"\\mathrm{d}\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{B/TM}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"FM 相的流变应力","symbol":"\\sigma_{\\mathrm{FM}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"FM 相的真应变增量","symbol":"\\mathrm{d}\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{FM}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"RA 相的流变应力","symbol":"\\sigma_{\\mathrm{RA}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"RA 相的真应变增量","symbol":"\\mathrm{d}\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{RA}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"DIM（变形诱发马氏体，Deformation-Induced Martensite）相的流变应力","symbol":"\\sigma_{\\mathrm{DIM}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"DIM 相的真应变增量","symbol":"\\mathrm{d}\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{DIM}}","unit":null,"value":null}],"unmapped":["公式中相缩写 F、B/TM、FM、RA 在提供的材料中未展开说明；仅 DIM 明确为 Deformation-Induced Martensite（变形诱发马氏体）。","该等功假设是后续式(2) σ(ε)=Σ f_j(ε_j)σ_j(ε_j) 的基础，即总流变应力由各相含量与各相流变应力乘积之和给出。"]}